/* zh-SG translations for "ch19" (generated by tools/i18n-pack.js; keys are the English source). */
Object.assign(window.I18N['zh-SG'].text, {
  "Chapter 19": "第十九章",
  "The Perfect Match": "完美配对",
  "Chapter 20 — Your Own Story": "第二十章 · 你自己的故事",
  "A long week in camp. {her} is busy with exams. You're scrolling on the bus home when a message request pops up.": "营里漫长的一个礼拜。{her}忙着考试。你在回家的巴士上滑手机，跳出一个陌生人的信息请求。",
  "Lin": "琳",
  "Oh sorry, wrong number! 😅 But you seem really nice. Can we chat?": "哎呀不好意思，传错人了！😅 不过你看起来人很好。可以聊聊吗？",
  "A long week in camp. Everyone in your section has a dating app. You download one at 11 PM, which Mochi calls \"the loneliest hour\".": "营里漫长的一个礼拜。班上每个人都有交友软件。你在晚上十一点下载了一个，麻糬说那是“最寂寞的时段”。",
  "Hi! Lin, 24, finance 💼 Your profile made me smile. Chat?": "嗨！我是琳，24岁，做金融💼 你的资料让我笑了。聊聊？",
  "Good morning dear 🌸 Have you eaten? You work so hard. I wish someone would take care of you like I would.": "早安亲爱的🌸 吃饭了没？你那么辛苦。真希望有人像我一样照顾你。",
  "Look, my crypto app made 18% this week 📈 My uncle taught me. Let me teach you, so we can build our future together.": "你看，我的加密货币软件这礼拜赚了18%📈 我舅舅教我的。我来教你，我们一起打造未来。",
  "A week of good-morning texts, and now a trading app.": "一个礼拜的早安简讯，现在来了个交易软件。",
  "Reverse-image search her photos. Don't invest. Report and block.": "用图片反搜她的照片。不投资。检举并封锁。",
  "The photos belong to a lifestyle influencer in another country, with 400,000 followers and no idea \"Lin\" exists.": "照片是别国一个生活网红的，有四十万粉丝，完全不知道“琳”这个人存在。",
  "Sweet talk, then a money tip, then \"our future\". The romance is the bait. The app is the hook.": "先甜言蜜语，再报你赚钱门路，然后讲“我们的未来”。恋爱是饵，软件是钩。",
  "Put in $200 to try. Only a little what.": "先放$200试试看。一点点而已嘛。",
  "See? +$46 already! 🥰 Now add margin and it doubles. Only $3,000. For us.": "你看！已经+$46了！🥰 现在加杠杆就翻倍。只要$3,000。为了我们。",
  "The app shows profit. You can't withdraw it.": "软件显示有赚钱。可是提不出来。",
  "Stop. Screenshot everything. Report to the police and call ScamShield 1799.": "停。全部截图。报警，再打给ScamShield 1799。",
  "Lost $200 and stopped? That's a win. This only works on people too paiseh to stop.": "亏$200然后停手？这是赢。这种骗局只对不好意思停手的人有用。",
  "Borrow money and add margin.": "借钱来加杠杆。",
  "BAD END #25 — The Soulmate Portfolio 2: Leveraged": "坏结局 #25 · 灵魂伴侣投资组合2：杠杆版",
  "The \"profits\" were numbers on a fake app. Every top-up went straight to the scammers, and the withdrawal fee was another trick. You were warned about this in JC, and it still worked, because it was built to work on lonely people. Never invest on the advice of someone you've only met online.": "那些“利润”只是假软件上的数字。每一次加码都直接进了骗子口袋，提款手续费也是另一个陷阱。你在JC时就被警告过，结果还是中了，因为它就是专门设计给寂寞的人的。永远不要听只在网上认识的人的话去投资。",
  "OKAY found a telegram travel agent. $450 return SFO to SIN for december!!! airline site says $1,300": "好啦 找到一个telegram旅行社 12月 旧金山来回新加坡 只要$450！！！航空公司网站要$1,300",
  "he says only 2 seats left and i have to paynow him tonight to hold them. should i??": "他说只剩2个位子 我今晚要paynow给他才能留位 要不要？？",
  "$450 for a $1,300 ticket. Tonight only.": "$1,300的机票只要$450。只限今晚。",
  "\"Video call me. Let's check the airline's own site together first. Real fares don't come from Telegram.\"": "“跟我视频。我们先一起上航空公司自己的网站查。真的票价不会从Telegram来。”",
  "On the call you both check the booking reference he sent. It doesn't exist. His Telegram account is nine days old.": "视频时你们一起查他给的订位代号。根本不存在。他的Telegram账号才开了九天。",
  "Oh my gosh. I almost sent it. I was so excited about seeing you I stopped thinking. Reporting him right now.": "天啊。我差点就转了。我太兴奋要见到你，脑袋就停止运作了。我现在就去举报他。",
  "Too cheap, too urgent, strange way to pay. Scammers love long-distance couples, because missing someone makes you hurry.": "太便宜、太急、付款方式很怪。骗子最爱远距离情侣，因为想念一个人会让你着急。",
  "\"Book it fast before it's gone!\"": "“快订，不然没了！”",
  "sent 😭 now he wants $200 more for \"seat insurance\"": "转了 😭 现在他又要多$200说是“座位保险”",
  "The ticket never existed. The \"insurance\" won't either. Report it, and next time check the airline's site first.": "那张票从来不存在。“保险”也不会存在。去举报，下次先上航空公司官网查。",
  "Guys, guys. VIP matchmaking agency. Dates with models, guaranteed. Just $300 deposit. Then a small \"verification fee\". Should I?": "各位、各位。VIP配对公司。保证跟模特约会。只要$300订金。然后一点点“认证费”。要不要？",
  "Ryan is holding his phone like it's a winning 4D ticket.": "瑞安拿着手机，好像拿着中了万字票的彩票。",
  "\"Walk away, bro. You can't buy someone liking you. And that agency doesn't exist.\"": "“兄弟，走开啦。别人的喜欢是买不到的。而且那间公司根本不存在。”",
  "...The website was made last week. Huh. Okay. I don't need another debt.": "……网站上礼拜才做的。嗯。好吧。我不需要再多一笔债。",
  "That night he finally rings his mum in Cork. You hear \"Mam? It's me,\" then a long quiet, then: \"Actually, Mam, no. Not grand. Can I tell you something?\"": "那天晚上，他终于打给在科克的妈妈。你听到：“妈？是我。”然后是很长的沉默，接着：“其实，妈，不是。不太好。我可以跟你说件事吗？”",
  "Deposit, verification fee, \"insurance\", silence. The girl in the photos never existed.": "订金、认证费、“保险”，然后消失。照片里的女生从来不存在。",
  "\"Go lah! Models!\"": "“去啊！模特耶！”",
  "Ryan pays $300, then $150 \"verification\", then $500 \"insurance\". The agency's number stops working on Friday.": "瑞安付了$300，然后$150“认证费”，再来$500“保险”。礼拜五，那间公司的电话就打不通了。",
  "If it's selling you a person, it's selling you nothing.": "如果它卖给你的是一个人，那它什么都没卖给你。",
  "A few nights later. A stranger from a gaming server you're in suddenly wants a video call. On camera, she starts undressing and asks you to do the same.": "几个晚上后。你在的游戏群组里，一个陌生人突然要跟你视讯。镜头前，她开始脱衣服，叫你也照做。",
  "Another match, very flirty. A video call at midnight. On camera, she starts undressing and asks you to do the same.": "另一个配对，很会撩。半夜视讯。镜头前，她开始脱衣服，叫你也照做。",
  "Something about the video looks pre-recorded.": "那段画面怎么看都像是预录的。",
  "Decline and end the call. Block and report.": "拒绝，挂断。封锁并检举。",
  "The \"woman\" was a loop of someone else's video. The target was a recording of you. Hanging up ended the scam.": "那个“女生”是别人影片的循环播放。他们要的是录下你。挂断，骗局就结束了。",
  "Go along with it.": "顺着她。",
  "Unknown": "未知号码",
  "I recorded everything. Pay $3,000 or I send it to all your contacts and your camp.": "我全部录下来了。付$3,000，不然我就传给你所有联络人和你的部队。",
  "Your stomach drops.": "你的心一下子沉到谷底。",
  "Don't pay. Keep the evidence, report to the platform and the police, call ScamShield 1799, tell someone you trust.": "不付。保留证据，向平台和警方举报，打ScamShield 1799，告诉一个你信任的人。",
  "You're the victim of a crime, not the one in trouble. Paying never ends it. It just proves you'll pay again.": "你是犯罪的受害者，不是闯祸的人。付钱永远不会结束。只会证明你会再付。",
  "Pay, so it goes away.": "付钱，让它消失。",
  "BAD END #26 — Paid in Full, Twice": "坏结局 #26 · 全额付清，两次",
  "You paid. Two days later they asked for more. Sextortion never ends with a payment, because paying shows them you will pay. Don't pay, keep the evidence, report it, and tell someone you trust. It's a crime against you, and you're not alone.": "你付了。两天后他们要更多。性勒索永远不会因为付钱而结束，因为付钱等于告诉他们你会付。不要付，保留证据，去举报，告诉一个你信任的人。这是针对你的犯罪，而你不是一个人。",
  "Brandon": "布兰登",
  "Bro! Long time! I'm with Alpha Kai's new network now. \"Wealth Mindset\" seminar on Saturday. Your friends are holding you back. You need a circle of winners.": "兄弟！好久不见！我现在在阿尔法·凯的新团队。礼拜六有“财富思维”讲座。你的朋友在拖你后腿。你需要一个赢家圈子。",
  "\"A circle of winners\" sounds suspiciously like a circle.": "“赢家圈子”听起来很可疑地像一个圈。",
  "Decline. Look up the reviews. Warn Haziq before they reach him.": "拒绝。去查评价。在他们找上哈齐克之前先提醒他。",
  "Reviews: \"had to buy $2,000 of starter stock\", \"lost all my friends\", \"the seminar was four hours of a man in a rented Lamborghini\".": "评价：“一开始要买$2,000的货”、“朋友全没了”、“讲座就是一个开租来林宝坚尼的男人讲了四个小时”。",
  "Sign up. You could be a winner.": "报名。你可能是赢家。",
  "Great! Now bring three people and your starter pack pays for itself!": "太好了！现在拉三个人进来，你的入门配套就回本了！",
  "Your upline wants three names.": "你的上线要三个名字。",
  "Quit. Ask for a refund. Warn your friends instead.": "退出。要求退款。反过来提醒你的朋友。",
  "Recruit Haziq and Mei.": "拉哈齐克和小美进来。",
  "BAD END #27 — Downline": "坏结局 #27 · 下线",
  "You recruited your best friend and your sister. They lost money, and you lost their trust. If a scheme mainly pays you for bringing in people, not for selling to real customers, the people at the bottom almost always lose. \"Your friends are holding you back\" is a tactic to isolate you.": "你拉了你最好的朋友和你姐姐。他们亏了钱，你失去了他们的信任。如果一个计划主要是靠拉人头赚钱，而不是卖东西给真正的顾客，底层的人几乎一定会亏。“你的朋友在拖你后腿”是用来孤立你的手段。",
  "A friend's \"sure thing\": recruit three people, get your money back, guaranteed. {her}: \"Is it really that bad?\"": "朋友的“稳赚”：拉三个人进来，保证回本。{her}：“真的有那么糟吗？”",
  "\"Let me think it through with you. What would have to be true for it to work?\"": "“我跟你一起想一下。要怎样它才会真的行得通？”",
  "\"If it only pays when you bring in people, it's a scheme. I'm not joining, and I'm not recruiting.\"": "“如果只有拉人才赚钱，那就是骗局。我不加入，也不拉人。”",
  "\"Everyone does it. If it's legal-ish, it's fine. Get in early.\"": "“大家都在做。差不多合法就好。早点上车。”",
  "\"Anyone who falls for that deserves to lose their money.\"": "“会上这种当的人，亏钱活该。”",
  "Chloe has a new \"business coach\" from the same network. He wants her to sell wellness tea from her stall. Starter pack: $3,000.": "可儿从同一个网络认识了一个新的“商业教练”。他要她在摊位卖养生茶。入门配套：$3,000。",
  "He says I'm thinking too small. Maybe I am?": "他说我想得太小了。也许我真的是？",
  "She nearly signed up for a scheme because it sounded like ambition.": "她差点加入一个计划，因为它听起来像是有野心。",
  "Chloe has the contract open.": "可儿已经打开合约了。",
  "Sit down and run the numbers out loud with her: starter pack, margins, who actually buys.": "坐下来，跟她一起把数字大声算一遍：入门配套、利润、到底谁会买。",
  "You ran the numbers out loud together.": "你们一起把数字大声算了一遍。",
  "Three thousand dollars to sell tea to my own customers, who'd rather buy kueh. ...Wow. I almost did that.": "花三千块，把茶卖给我自己的客人，而他们只想买糕。……哇。我差一点就签了。",
  "\"Your call. You're the business person.\"": "“你决定吧。你才是做生意的人。”",
  "Respecting her choices doesn't mean staying quiet when you can see the trap.": "尊重她的选择，不代表看到陷阱时要闭嘴。",
  "Thursday, 2 PM. Ah Ma's phone rings. \"This is Officer Tan from the police. Your bank account is involved in money laundering. Transfer $8,000 to a safe account now, or we arrest you.\"": "礼拜四，下午两点。阿嬷的手机响了。“我是警察陈警官。你的银行户口涉及洗钱。马上把 $8,000 转到安全户口，不然我们就逮捕你。”",
  "A voice that sounded official told her to move her savings.": "一个听起来很官方的声音叫她把存款转走。",
  "Officer Tan, my grandson say real police never ask money on the phone. I call him first. Bye bye!": "陈警官，我孙子说真的警察从来不会在电话里要钱。我先打给他。拜拜！",
  "She hangs up, calls you, and then reports the number on ScamShield herself.": "她挂了电话，打给你，然后自己在 ScamShield 上举报了那个号码。",
  "She hung up and called you first.": "她挂了电话，先打给你。",
  "By the time Mum gets home, Ah Ma has transferred $2,000. The bank freezes the rest.": "等妈妈回到家，阿嬷已经转了 $2,000。银行冻结了剩下的钱。",
  "Ah Ma so stupid. Don't tell anybody.": "阿嬷好笨。不要跟任何人讲。",
  "Ah Ma won't look at anyone.": "阿嬷不敢看任何人。",
  "\"You're not stupid, Ah Ma. They're professionals. Let's call the bank and the police together, now.\"": "“阿嬷，你不笨。他们是专业的骗子。我们现在一起打给银行和警察。”",
  "Scam fact card: call your bank's 24-hour hotline to freeze transfers. Report to the police: 999 if it's urgent, or the police e-services website. Install ScamShield. Real officers never ask you to transfer money.": "防骗小知识：打给银行的 24 小时热线冻结转账。向警方报案：紧急情况拨 999，或使用警察电子服务网站。安装 ScamShield。真正的警察从来不会叫你转钱。",
  "\"Ah Ma, how could you fall for that?\"": "“阿嬷，你怎么会被骗？”",
  "She's already blaming herself. Shame is what scammers count on to keep people quiet. Report it, together, now.": "她已经在怪自己了。骗子就是靠羞耻感让人不敢出声。现在就一起去报案。",
  "Sunday lunch at the Tan Rojas flat. Mateo's mum answers her phone in Spanish, then goes pale.": "陈·罗哈斯家的星期天午餐。马特奥的妈妈用西班牙语接电话，接着脸色发白。",
  "Bro. It's \"the Colombian embassy\". They say her passport is linked to a money-laundering case. She has to move her savings to a \"safe account\" today or be arrested.": "兄弟。是“哥伦比亚大使馆”。他们说她的护照跟一宗洗钱案有关。她今天就要把存款转到一个“安全账户”，不然会被逮捕。",
  "His mum is already opening her banking app.": "他妈妈已经打开银行App了。",
  "\"Tell her to hang up. We find the embassy's real number on its official website and call that.\"": "“叫她挂掉。我们去大使馆的官方网站找真正的电话，打那个。”",
  "She hangs up. Mateo finds the number on the embassy's official site. The real embassy says what real embassies always say: we never ask for money over the phone.": "她挂了电话。马特奥在大使馆官网找到号码。真正的大使馆说了所有真正大使馆都会说的话：我们绝对不会在电话里跟你要钱。",
  "Hermano. You saved my mamá's savings. She says you're invited to lunch forever.": "Hermano。你救了我mamá的存款。她说你永远都可以来吃午餐。",
  "Real officials never ask you to move money to a \"safe account\". Hang up, find the number yourself, call back. In any language.": "真正的官员绝对不会叫你把钱转到“安全账户”。挂掉，自己找号码，再打回去。用什么语言都一样。",
  "\"Better do what they say. Just in case.\"": "“还是照他们说的做吧。以防万一。”",
  "Mateo grabs the phone a second before she presses send. Nobody says much for the rest of lunch.": "马特奥在她按下发送前一秒抢过手机。那顿午餐后来大家都没怎么说话。",
  "\"Just in case\" is exactly the feeling they're selling. Real officials don't rush you to transfer money.": "“以防万一”正是他们在卖的那种感觉。真正的官员不会催你转账。",
  "Look. \"Lin, 26, wine trader.\" My friend from church has been chatting with him for a month. Same photos as an influencer in Taiwan. I reverse-searched. Help me tell her gently? She's so lonely.": "你看。“林，26 岁，葡萄酒商。”我教会的朋友跟他聊了一个月。照片跟台湾一个网红的一模一样，我用以图搜图查过了。帮我温柔地跟她讲好吗？她很孤单。",
  "She spotted a fake profile and wanted to protect her friend's feelings.": "她识破了一个假账号，还想顾及朋友的感受。",
  "How do you help?": "你要怎么帮？",
  "Help her write a kind message: the evidence, no \"how could you\", and the scam hotline.": "帮她写一条温和的讯息：附上证据，不说“你怎么会”，再附上防骗热线。",
  "\"Just screenshot it to her lah.\"": "“直接截图给她就好啦。”",
  "Then Natalie goes quiet. A whole week. No replies.": "然后娜塔莉就不说话了。整整一个礼拜，没有回复。",
  "She went silent for a week.": "她沉默了一个礼拜。",
  "Before I spotted Lin, there was someone else. I sent him $1,200. I couldn't tell you. I couldn't tell anyone.": "在发现“林”之前，还有另一个人。我转了 $1,200 给他。我没办法跟你讲。我没办法跟任何人讲。",
  "She told you about the $1,200.": "她告诉你那 $1,200 的事。",
  "Natalie can't look at you.": "娜塔莉不敢看你。",
  "\"Thank you for telling me. Let's report it together. Rae's hotline helped Haziq. No judgement.\"": "“谢谢你告诉我。我们一起去报案。瑞儿那条热线帮过哈齐克。不会批评你。”",
  "You reported it together, with no judgement.": "你们一起去报案，没有任何批评。",
  "...Okay. Together. Thank you for not looking at me like I'm stupid.": "……好。一起。谢谢你没有用看笨蛋的眼神看我。",
  "\"You of all people? You spotted Lin!\"": "“连你也会？你可是识破了‘林’的人！”",
  "I know. That's why I didn't tell you.": "我知道。所以我才没跟你讲。",
  "A week later she sends a thumbs-up. Nothing else. Some things take more trust than you've built so far.": "一个礼拜后，她传来一个竖大拇指。没有别的了。有些事需要的信任，比你目前建立的还要多。",
  "A community talk at the polytechnic: \"How scams target lonely men\". The speaker is Rae.": "理工学院的社区讲座：“骗局如何锁定寂寞的男人”。讲者是瑞儿。",
  "Two years ago, I was the girl in the script. I know every line. Here they are.": "两年前，我就是剧本里的那个女生。每一句台词我都知道。现在念给你们听。",
  "A community talk at the polytechnic: \"How scams target lonely men\". The speaker, to your surprise, is Rae.": "理工学院的社区讲座：“骗局如何锁定寂寞的男人”。让你意外的是，讲者是瑞儿。",
  "I got out of an \"agency\" last year, with help from a hotline and a very patient caseworker. Now I teach the script, so you can spot it.": "我去年从一间“公司”逃出来，靠的是一条热线和一位很有耐心的社工。现在我来教大家那套剧本，让你们认得出来。",
  "Sweet talk. A crisis. Money. Secrecy. See that pattern, stop. And if it already got you: you're not stupid. You were targeted by professionals.": "甜言蜜语。出事了。要钱。要保密。看到这个套路，就停。如果已经中招了：你不笨。你是被专业的人盯上的。",
  "Bro. After that talk... there's this girl messaging me. Sweet, every day. Now she needs $800 for a \"hospital bill\". I almost sent it.": "兄弟。听完那个讲座……有个女生一直在传信息给我。每天都很甜。现在她说要$800付“医药费”。我差点就转过去了。",
  "Haziq looks like he wants the floor to swallow him.": "哈齐克一副想钻进地洞的样子。",
  "\"That's exactly the script. You did the hardest part, telling me. Let's report it together. No judgement.\"": "“这就是那套剧本。最难的那步你已经做了，就是跟我讲。我们一起去举报。不会笑你。”",
  "...Okay. Thanks for not laughing. I really thought she liked me.": "……好。谢谢你没有笑。我真的以为她喜欢我。",
  "Scammers need shame. You just took it away.": "骗子需要你觉得丢脸。你刚刚把它拿走了。",
  "\"How dumb are you?\"": "“你是有多笨？”",
  "This is why nobody tells anyone anything.": "这就是为什么没有人会跟别人讲任何事。",
  "He came to you before sending money. Next time, he'll come to no one.": "他在转钱之前来找你。下次，他谁都不会找了。",
  "After the talk, Rae walks with you to Uncle Ong's café. Ollie is at the counter, staring at his phone.": "讲座结束后，瑞儿陪你走去王伯的咖啡店。奥利在柜台前，盯着手机。",
  "Found a studio. Tiong Bahru, $1,100 a month, which is mad. Agent's overseas, so no viewing. Just a $2,000 deposit to hold it. Was about to send it, to be honest.": "找到一间套房。中峇鲁，一个月$1,100，很离谱。中介在国外，所以不能看房。只要付$2,000订金就能留着。说实话，我正准备转。",
  "He nearly paid a $2,000 deposit rather than ask for a viewing.": "他宁愿付$2,000订金，也不好意思要求看房。",
  "Rae raises an eyebrow at you.": "瑞儿对你挑了挑眉。",
  "\"Ollie, that's a third of the usual rent, no viewing, overseas agent. Can we check the agent on the CEA register first?\"": "“奥利，这只有一般租金的三分之一，不能看房，中介又在国外。我们可以先在CEA名册上查一下这个中介吗？”",
  "Too cheap, no viewing, pay first. That's three lines from my script. Check the register.": "太便宜、不能看房、先付钱。这是我那份剧本里的三句台词。查名册。",
  "The agent's name isn't on the Council for Estate Agencies public register. The flat photos come from a listing in another city.": "这个中介的名字不在房地产代理理事会的公开名册上。房子的照片来自另一个城市的租房广告。",
  "Right. Should've asked. I'm rubbish at asking. ...Thanks, both of you. Reporting it now.": "对。早该问的。我很不会开口求人。……谢谢你们两个。我现在就去举报。",
  "He let you and Rae help him check, then reported it.": "他让你和瑞儿帮他查，然后去举报了。",
  "\"Wah, cheap. Grab it.\"": "“哇，便宜。快租。”",
  "No. Ollie, don't. Check the agent's registration first.": "不行。奥利，别。先查中介有没有注册。",
  "Rae spotted it. You nearly cheered it on. Too good to be true usually is.": "瑞儿看出来了。你差点还在旁边叫好。好到不像真的，通常就不是真的。"
});
